it:{challenges:['Recurring IT interruptions affect employee productivity','Networks and devices are difficult to maintain consistently','Infrastructure needs proactive monitoring and planning'],steps:[['Assess','Review your current infrastructure, systems, and support needs.'],['Prioritize','Identify risks, recurring issues, and the most important improvements.'],['Support & Optimize','Address technical needs and help maintain a stable environment.']],faqs:[['Can you support our existing IT environment?','Support can be focused around the infrastructure and systems your business already uses. The exact scope should be discussed with the team.'],['Do you provide ongoing IT support?','The service covers day-to-day user support and ongoing infrastructure management. Support arrangements should be confirmed based on your needs.'],['Can you help improve an existing network?','Network administration and infrastructure optimization are included areas of expertise.']]},
